## Konfigürasyon Şeması (`agent.yaml`)

```yaml
server_id: web-server-01          # Unique, backend'de kayıtlı olmalı
backend_url: http://localhost:8000
api_key: usalp-agent-xxx          # Backend'deki AGENT_API_KEY ile eşleşmeli

intervals:
  fast: 30      # saniye — CPU, RAM, Network
  slow: 60      # saniye — Disk, Process listesi

services:
  - nginx
  - docker
  - postgresql
  - redis

log_files:
  - path: /var/log/nginx/error.log
    tail_lines: 100
    min_level: ERROR              # DEBUG|INFO|WARNING|ERROR|CRITICAL
  - path: /var/log/syslog
    tail_lines: 50
    min_level: WARNING
```

